---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Terms and Conditions — Property Operations SMS"
  description="Terms and conditions for property operations SMS support."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 3rem; max-width: 820px;">
    <span class="eyebrow">SMS Terms</span>
    <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      These terms cover non-marketing property operations SMS support for
      message recipients, applicants, service providers, and operations
      contacts.
    </p>

    <h2>Program Description</h2>
    <p>
      Property operations SMS support is used for property operations support,
      including maintenance acknowledgements, repair follow-up, appointment
      coordination, service requests, application follow-up, and vendor
      scheduling. The program does not send marketing or promotional messages.
    </p>

    <h2>Consent</h2>
    <p>
      Users opt in by texting the support number after receiving it from
      application follow-up, appointment coordination, or direct operations and
      vendor coordination. Existing message recipients, applicants, service
      providers, and operations contacts may also provide verbal consent during
      maintenance, application, or scheduling communication.
    </p>

    <h2>Message Frequency</h2>
    <p>
      Message frequency varies based on the user's service request, maintenance
      issue, application question, appointment coordination need, or vendor
      scheduling interaction.
    </p>

    <h2>Message and Data Rates</h2>
    <p>
      Message and data rates may apply according to the user's mobile carrier
      plan. Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.
    </p>

    <h2>Help and Opt Out</h2>
    <p>
      Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance. Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to
      opt out of SMS replies. After opting out, users may reply
      <strong>START</strong> to resubscribe.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The privacy policy for this SMS program is available at
      <a href="/privacy/">https://sciencesloop.com/privacy/</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For SMS support or questions about these terms, contact
      <a href="mailto:zhanglu77@gmail.com">zhanglu77@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
